      <data key="e_vosonTxt_comment">JUSTICE FOR LEXI YOUNG, KRISTEN VAGANOS AND 330 MILLION ENDOMETRIOSIS WARRIORS

     Once again ABC is disgracing 330,000,000 Endometriosis Warriors. Presently by totally erasing the history of General Hospital’s “Molly Lansing Davis” (Kristen Vaganos) having Endometriosis, only once having a mild reference during Irene/Adele’s funeral and Mollys half sister Kristina Cornthos (Kate Mansi) killing her surrogate, with no mention that “Molly’s” Endometriosis fertility.

       Now, instead of having what I have tirelessly crusaded for Lexi Young Bachelorette: Endo Summer of 202?, “Where Love Conquers All.” Where 20 biological males who abandoned an Endo warrior when they came out, like Lexi’s did in New York, seek redemption from Lexi, (just about the bravest dropdead gorgeous super beautiful heroine in the world.) that would raise awareness to Endometriosis and all the barbaric tortures Endo Warriors have to go through.
      Instead of honoring just about the greatest hero/heroine in the history of the universe, Lexi Young, who metaphorically walks on water, splits the read sea and maker of heaven and earth by showing what would be about 10 million Americans the barbaric struggles of Endo Warriors. With a significant portion of and profits donated to a Lexi Young Endometriosis Foundation.
       ABC has decided that some Mormon Housewives’ Taylor Franke Paul would be the next Bachelorette. Instead of providing public awareness of the most barbaric torture inflicted on almost all beautiful white women. ABC will promote a divorce of a sex scandal, adulterer, a mother of 3 none of which she had a significant relationship let alone a marriage and a  arrested domestic abuser many times in front of her children. Along with many other rumored yet not confirmed horrible acts she has done.

         Instead of raising tens of millions of dollars for hundreds of thousands of young endo girls, to have the early in life (15 years old) life saving Excision surgeries when Endo is still entirely in the reproductive system that can easily be entirely removed never to grow to places it can never be removed, that will for the next half century and half millions of dollars or at least a dozen surgeries regrow faster than it can be removed.  ABC will instead pay $250,000 to a person even worse than Jen Tran.

         Instead of showing the barbaric Endo tortures and the support males have to provide for ovarian cysts bursting during retrograde menstruation and the vaginal bleeding down their legs on to their already inflamed vulvadynas with torture so intense as to cause fainting and temporary blindness. Along with the yelling and screaming so loud, coworkers, neighbors, classmates down a long hall when the Endo that could have been removed early in life, has spread to the bladder, colon and stomach that further adds frequent vomiting.

          ABC will likely glamourize Taylor talking about all the child support she gets from her 3 baby daddies. The many ways she hurt her husband and kids, and details of her sex scandals. While once again both in fiction on General Hospital and in real life Lexi Young, the barbaric torture of Endometriosis will be ignored as though Lexi,  Kristen and Haley Pullous never existed.

     
The Bachelorette was cursed, , choosing Jenn Tran where the worst season of any tv show made everyone not want to  “ Bring on the Jennergy” instead of “Lexi Young: Endometriosis Summer of 2024” “Where Love Conquers All.” Where millions of lives and billions of hours of suffering could have been saved by donating a large portion of ad profits for all future Bachelors and variations and all ABC shows even Retroactive to all previous Bachelors to a Lexi Young Endometriosis Foundation that Lexi the 4.0 gpa MIT graduate and now world’s best digital strategist would be CEO.

By now millions of low income level Young Endo Girls, that the LYEF would focused on could have gotten the live saving, before 15 years old excision surgeries. 

Not only would hundreds of millions of dollars been raised by now, but tens of millions of viewers could have learned all about the most barbaric torture to the most drop dead gorgeous super beautiful heroines that save the world and how when they come out are abandoned by friends, employers, fiancés due to Endophobia. Where male bachelors who once abandoned an Endo Warrior get Lexi through Endo flares(like the one that was in the initial phase when Lexi was on “Women Tell All.”, medical gaslighting, vomiting due to endo that spread to the stomach, passing out in the bathroom due to Endo that spread to the bladder and colon.

There is no cure and ‘treatments’ are worse than Endometriosis itself. The most commonly described treatments Lupron and Orlissa causes suicidal contemplations in 38% of Endo warriors.   

A parent should be able to tell if their daughter has Endo if they are normally vibrant, hard working pillars of society who are ready for school an hour before the mother or father are even out of the shower. But seemingly every month at the same time they complain of how much it hurts to urinate and defecate and change their tampons, eat, are nauseas  or even bend over and are still in bed long after the whole family is ready for car pool  departure.   And every month it gets longer and more intense.
  
The entirety of  Endometriosis is the lack of knowledge and awareness of parents who conclude their daughters as having a low pain threshold or carrying on wanting to get attention, having something they are always trying to get out of, being hysterical or for some paranoid parents their daughters trying to make them look abusive.  And instead of taking care of their daughters they discipline them and investigate what they are trying to get out of instead of investigating what is medically wrong with them. 

Throughout their entire first half century of life, family, friends, coworkers deal with their Endometriosis is to call them hypochondriacs. Even in ER’s they are dismissed seldom getting any type of medical care but some Tylenol or laxative. Tracey’s Lindeman’s book “Bleed” documents the medical gaslighting that mostly beautiful women are tortured by i the medical community.

Most Young Endo girls then adult Endo warriors spend their lives hiding their symptoms as much as possible after spending their early lives being disciplined by parents and teachers, mocked by friends who they think they can confide.  Then by employers who will most certainly fire them, demote them or give them so few hours not  to be able to pay even rent, let alone all the medical costs.

Last summer ABC chose superficiality over Endometriosis. Now they are going to glamourize to the disgrace of tens of millions of domestic abused, with an episode on the anniversary of June 12, 1994 the night Nicole Brown’s domestic abuse ended that incarnated, thanks to an Akita that woke everyone up, the domestic abuse barbarism.




 Viewers suffered the horrible ego of Jenn  ending in the appropriate  poetic justice of Devin having an affair with Maria. Instead of the Joey finale ending with Lexi surprised as the new Bachelorette with dozens of Young Endo girls waiting in hospitals for their surgeries already paid for by the LYEF she didn’t even know existed, with Daisy, Kelsey, Racheal, Maria  riding with her in the same van and black pants and brown sweater she is confused to be wearing, to the hospital.

All with the closing scene.  Of Lexi getting a text message that she is not just the Bachelorette but  CEO with a sign from all the YEG’s waiting, “You’re going to give millions of us our lives.But we all hope you find your final rose in the Endo Summer of 2024. Offering to all, what ABC wants to deny.

HOPE FOR THE FUTURE
THAT
WE’LL FIND TOMORROW
STEVE BAYT 
PARMA.OHIIO

       






